::* {{cog|ae|𐬨𐬀𐬥𐬎𐬱||human}}
::* {{cog|sa|मनुस्<t:human>,मनु<t:human; humanity; thought”; “thinking; wise; intelligent>}}
::* Also {{cog|sa|म॒नु॒ष्य॑|t=human; man; huband|pos=whence {{m+|en|manusya}}}}
